    {
      "id": "fbbr8riejzg0udq2ppcpuidj",
      "content": "No, ⁢⁤⁣‍⁡‌⁤⁡‍‌⁢⁡‍⁤⁡‍⁢‍⁡‌⁤⁢‌⁣⁢‌‍⁢⁢‌⁡‍⁡‌⁣⁡‍⁢⁡⁢‌⁢‌⁡‍‌‌⁡‌⁢⁢⁢‌⁢⁢⁡‌⁢‍⁢‌⁡‌⁡⁣‌⁡‌⁤it isn’t.",
      "english": "No ⁢⁤⁣‍⁡‌⁤⁡‍‌⁢⁡‍⁤⁡‍⁢‍⁡‌⁤⁢‌⁣⁢‌‍⁢⁢‌⁡‍⁡‌⁣⁡‍⁢⁡⁢‌⁢‌⁡‍‌‌⁡‌⁢⁢⁢‌⁢⁢⁡‌⁢‍⁢‌⁡‌⁡⁣‌⁡‌⁤, it isn't",
